This category lists Cats with the [[Soulstrike]] ability introduced in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. This ability allows Cats to target and attack [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] corpses as though they were regular enemies instead of just walking past them. This can be useful to damage them and inflict status debuffs on them before they even revive, and it can even prevent them from reviving altogether.
